# .npmrc.example
# Copy this to .npmrc and set the appropriate environment variables

# For GitHub Packages (@tetherto scope):
@tetherto:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com/
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${GITHUB_TOKEN}

# For npm registry (@qvac scope):
@qvac:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}

# ========================================
# SWITCHING BETWEEN REGISTRIES
# ========================================

# Option 1: Use environment variables (RECOMMENDED)
# Set in PowerShell:
#   $env:GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_YourGitHubToken"
#   $env:NPM_TOKEN="npm_YourNpmToken"
#
# Or set as Windows environment variables permanently:
#   System Properties → Environment Variables → User variables

# Option 2: Use package-specific versions
# For @tetherto/qvac-sdk (GitHub):
#   Use version like "0.10.1" with GITHUB_TOKEN
# For @qvac/sdk (npm):
#   Use version like "0.2.3-dev.1760899404.f30d071" with NPM_TOKEN

# ========================================
# CURRENT SETUP
# ========================================
# Package: @tetherto/qvac-sdk@0.10.1
# Registry: GitHub Packages
# Token needed: GITHUB_TOKEN


